{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c1e11076-829e-4b02-9641-6b48b095d475","hash":"adff4c9c6a99d068bbe711c3f309875a549dd0735ee9213ba6b871bf9c0cefac","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Agreed. That gives the two kinds opposite jobs. I'm updating the prototype so a citation badge carries its own reference data inside the file, and a status badge visibly dates itself and expires. Then I'll write the rule down."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Rw6YMNGozFvGwTWnBojwct","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/srvo/dev/anthropic-pbc && grep -v '^#' derived/recipes.tsv | head -3 | cut -c1-200; grep -v '^#' sources/MANIFEST.tsv | grep -i s1a1 | cut -c1-250","description":"Read the recipe and manifest formats to build citation data"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
